From d48f6e84f441fee67bcced01cd4aa83217fed359 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mir Mohammad Sajedul Islam <mohammad.sajedul.islam@g.bracu.ac.bd>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 16:49:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign landing page, add free sandbox, retheme app to
 sky/cloud palette

- New interactive landing page: navbar, dual Physics/Chemistry hero with a
  single lazy-loaded Three.js canvas and a CSS fallback for weak devices
- No-login sandbox: projectile motion and acid/base pH mixer
- Retheme dashboard, admin, login, register, footer and AI chat to the new
  sky blue / cloudy white / #CC310E palette
